# Implementation Plan - Dashboard Optimization

The goal is to optimize the dashboard data loading, ensure "All Years" is the default view, and simplify the loading experience.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> The "All Years" default seems to be the current intended behavior in the frontend code. I will verify if the backend respects this and if the "loading" optimizations create a smoother experience.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend ([public/dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js))

#### [MODIFY] [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js)
- Refactor [loadDashboardData](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#240-306) to fetch categorical breakdown data in parallel with summary data.
- Pass the pre-fetched categorical data to rendering functions to avoid a "waterfall" loading effect.
- Ensure the `year` parameter is explicitly set to `'all'` when fetching categorical breakdown on initial load.
- Remove the separate, delayed call to [loadCategoricalBreakdown](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#436-608) if the data is already available.

### Styling ([public/loading-states.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/loading-states.css))

#### [MODIFY] [loading-states.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/loading-states.css)
- Simplify the loading animation or overlay.
- Make it less intrusive (e.g., smaller spinner or skeleton loader instead of full-screen blocking if that's the case).

### Backend ([server.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/server.js) or separate route file)

#### [MODIFY] [server.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/server.js) (or relevant route file)
- Verify `categorical-breakdown` route handles `year=all` correctly (aggregating potentially).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Load Dashboard**: Open [public/dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.html) (via server) and observe the network tab. All major data requests should start simultaneously.
- **Default View**: Confirm that "All Years" is selected in the dropdown and the data displayed matches the total of all years.
- **Loading State**: Refresh the page and observe the loading indicator. It should be "simpler" (subjective, but based on code changes) and the content should appear more snappily.
